      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "missing",
      "review_flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "Recently, a new group of thieves has been hanging around Northshire. They call themselves the Defias Brotherhood, and have been seen across the river to the east.\nI don't know what they're up to, but I'm sure it's not good! Bring me the bandanas they wear, and I'll reward you with a weapon.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "Your previous investigations are proof that the Echo Ridge Mine needs purging. Return to the mine and help clear it of kobolds.\nWaste no time, adventurer. The longer the kobolds are left unmolested in the mine, the deeper a foothold they gain in Northshire.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": [
        "check_original_player_placeholders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3903,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "You've shown yourself a dependable class, adventurer. Dependable, and not afraid to get your hands dirty, eh?\nI have a friend, Milly Osworth, who's in some trouble. She's over with her wagon on the other side of the abbey, near the stable. I'm sure she could use a pair of hands like yours.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": [
        "check_original_player_placeholders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3905,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "Now that my crop is saved, take this Grape Manifest to Brother Neals. He manages the store of food and drink in Northshire, and I'm sure he'll be delighted to hear that he has fresh grapes.\nYou'll find Brother Neals in the abbey, in the bell tower... where he likes to taste his wine.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": 91772,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "Alright. Take this kobold tracking kit. It'll let ye' track the kobold that Marshal McBride is concerned with.\nFollow the tracks and bring what ye' find to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.\nI have a feelin' these varmints are up to somethin' outside Northshire. So ye'll be needin' Dughan's help.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": 92462,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "One of our rangers recently reported an infestation of cirrusflies here in Thendal Grove.\nCirrusflies can be dangerous if the swarm is allowed to grow too large, so please head to the eastern end of the Grove and exterminate as many as you can.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": 92481,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "While you were away dealing with our vuldren problem, our resident mage trainer--Dorii Brightwhisper--left this recall crystal for you. It contains some sort of message for you, so give it a look. Afterwards, you can find Dorii in the structure just behind me.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "missing",
      "review_flags": []
    },
    {
      "id": 96627,
      "field": "text",
      "en": "adventurer, you have proven your competence as a protector thus far. That is why I am now entrusting you with an unusual task.\nI've heard of a new adventurer down the road by Goldshire. Go and see what he's doing.",
      "source_delta": "added",
      "status": "changed",
      "review_flags": [
        "check_original_player_placeholders"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
